Phase 10 — Security review

In: Secrets not in git, no real PII, threat tests in CI.
Out: PCI claims.
Done when: the security checklist is green.

Implementation: tracked-tree scan fails on private JWKs, PEMs, sk_live, and
Luhn PANs. JSON logs redact keys and DSN passwords. .dockerignore keeps
secrets out of images. GitHub Actions runs tests/threat_model (A–G, H, H2)
and tests/security. No PCI / SOX / GDPR / Mastercard-partnership claims.
